---
import mark from './blackout-mark.svg?raw';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><title>Blackout Browser — Make space for the web.</title><meta name="description" content="Meet Blackout for Windows. Flexible tabs, window recovery, private windows, themes and a built-in music player, in one considered desktop browser."/><link rel="canonical" href="https://pactuno.online/blackout.html"/><meta property="og:title" content="Blackout — Make space for the web."/><meta property="og:description" content="A considered desktop browser. Your tabs, your rhythm, your space."/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta property="og:url" content="https://pactuno.online/blackout.html"/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg"/><script is:inline>
try{const t=localStorage.getItem('blackout-page-theme');if(t==='light'||t==='dark')document.documentElement.dataset.theme=t}catch{}
</script></head>
<body>
<a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
<header class="sitebar"><a class="brand" href="/blackout.html"><span set:html={mark} aria-hidden="true"></span>Blackout</a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#experience">Experience</a><a href="#features">Features</a><a href="#questions">Questions</a></nav><div class="header-actions"><label class="theme-label"><span class="sr-only">Appearance</span><select id="appearance" aria-label="Appearance"><option value="system">System</option><option value="light">Light</option><option value="dark">Dark</option></select></label><a class="button small" href="/downloads/Blackout-Setup.exe">Download</a></div></header>
<main id="main">
<section class="hero wrap"><p class="eyebrow">BLACKOUT FOR WINDOWS</p><h1>Make space<br/>for the web.</h1><p class="lede">Your tabs. Your rhythm. Your space.<br/>A desktop browser that brings it all together.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/downloads/Blackout-Setup.exe" download="Blackout-Setup.exe">Get for Windows</a><a class="text-link" href="#experience">Take a closer look</a></div><p class="caption">Free download · Windows 64-bit · Early access</p>
<div class="browser" id="experience"><div class="chrome"><span class="mini-mark" set:html={mark} aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="preview-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Browser preview"><button id="preview-focus" role="tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="preview-panel" data-view="focus">Your space</button><button id="preview-tabs" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="preview-panel" tabindex="-1" data-view="tabs">Better tabs</button><button id="preview-music" role="tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="preview-panel" tabindex="-1" data-view="music">Your rhythm</button></div><span class="window-dots" aria-hidden="true">− &nbsp; □ &nbsp; ×</span></div><div class="addressbar"><span aria-hidden="true">‹ &nbsp; › &nbsp; ↻</span><div>blackout://<span id="preview-address">home</span></div><span aria-hidden="true">☆</span></div><div class="preview-page" id="preview-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="preview-focus"><div class="ambient" aria-hidden="true"></div><p class="eyebrow" id="preview-kicker">THE SIGNAL IS YOURS</p><h2 id="preview-title">A little less noise.<br/>A lot more room.</h2><p id="preview-copy">Bring your favorite places into focus.</p><div class="search-preview" aria-hidden="true"><span>⌕</span> Search or enter an address <kbd>Enter</kbd></div><div class="favorites" aria-hidden="true"><span>Work</span><span>Read</span><span>Listen</span><span>Explore</span></div></div><p class="preview-caption">Interactive illustration of Blackout. Download the app for the full experience.</p></div></section>
<section class="intro wrap" id="features"><p class="eyebrow">SMALL DETAILS. A BETTER EVERYDAY.</p><h2>Everything in its place.<br/>Including you.</h2><div class="feature-grid"><article class="feature wide"><span class="number">01</span><h3>Tabs that move<br/>with your thinking.</h3><p>Drag tabs left or right. Switch with a click. Double-click a tab title to close it. Simple gestures, right where you expect them.</p><div class="tab-art" aria-hidden="true"><span>Research</span><span class="selected">The next idea</span><span>Notes</span></div></article><article class="feature"><span class="number">02</span><h3>Pick up<br/>where you left off.</h3><p>Press Ctrl + Shift + T to reopen a closed tab. After a restart, the same shortcut can restore a closed normal window and its tabs.</p><kbd class="shortcut">Ctrl + Shift + T</kbd></article><article class="feature"><span class="number">03</span><h3>Set your<br/>own atmosphere.</h3><p>Choose themes and keep your favorite sites close. A built-in music player brings another part of your day into the same window.</p><div class="swatches" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div></article><article class="feature wide quiet"><span class="number">04</span><h3>A private window.<br/>When you need one.</h3><p>Private windows use a separate in-memory session and are excluded from saved window recovery. Your network provider and the sites you visit can still see network activity.</p><a class="text-link" href="#questions">Understand early access</a></article></div></section>
<section class="film wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">MEET BLACKOUT</p><h2>A closer look.<br/>At your own pace.</h2><p>See the browser in motion.</p></div><a class="film-link" href="/blackout-film.html"><span class="play" aria-hidden="true">▷</span><span>Watch the Blackout film</span></a></section>
<section class="faq wrap" id="questions"><div><p class="eyebrow">A FEW THINGS TO KNOW</p><h2>Clear from<br/>the start.</h2></div><div class="questions"><details><summary>What can I install today?</summary><p>The Windows 64-bit desktop app is available now. Blackout is in early access, so features and compatibility will continue to evolve.</p></details><details><summary>How do I get updates?</summary><p>Use the stable download button on this page for the current installer. Your normal profile, favorites and history are preserved when updating the installed app.</p></details><details><summary>Does a private window make me anonymous?</summary><p>No. It separates local session data and does not enter saved window recovery. Websites, your network provider, downloads and other software can still leave traces. Blackout is not a VPN.</p></details><details><summary>Are all protection controls finished?</summary><p>No. Protection controls remain in development. This page does not claim independently audited security, complete tracker blocking or anonymity.</p></details><details><summary>Where can I report a problem?</summary><p><a href="https://github.com/justokaywith/blackout-browser/issues">Open an issue on GitHub</a> with your app version and steps to reproduce. Keep passwords, private browsing data and credentials out of reports.</p></details></div></section>
<section class="closing wrap"><span class="closing-mark" set:html={mark} aria-hidden="true"></span><h2>A fresh window.<br/>A little more possibility.</h2><a class="button" href="/downloads/Blackout-Setup.exe" download="Blackout-Setup.exe">Get for Windows</a><p class="caption">Free · Windows 64-bit · Early access</p></section>
</main><footer class="wrap"><a href="/">Pactuno</a><span>Blackout Browser</span><div><a href="/privacy.html">Privacy</a><a href="/terms.html">Terms</a><a href="https://github.com/justokaywith/blackout-browser">GitHub</a></div></footer>
<script is:inline src="/brand/blackout-page.js?v=1" defer></script>
<style is:global>
:root{color-scheme:light;--bg:#f5f5f7;--surface:#fff;--ink:#1d1d1f;--muted:#626268;--line:#dcdce1;--accent:#0066cc;--soft:#e9e9ee;--focus:#0071e3}
@media(prefers-color-scheme:dark){:root:not([data-theme="light"]){color-scheme:dark;--bg:#101012;--surface:#1c1c1f;--ink:#f5f5f7;--muted:#b0b0b8;--line:#39393f;--accent:#83baff;--soft:#2b2b30;--focus:#83baff}}
:root[data-theme="dark"]{color-scheme:dark;--bg:#101012;--surface:#1c1c1f;--ink:#f5f5f7;--muted:#b0b0b8;--line:#39393f;--accent:#83baff;--soft:#2b2b30;--focus:#83baff}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth;scroll-padding-top:100px}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;line-height:1.5;letter-spacing:-.018em}a{color:var(--accent)}button,select{font:inherit}a,button,select,summary{-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}a:focus-visible,button:focus-visible,select:focus-visible,summary:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus);outline-offset:5px}a{text-decoration:none}button,summary{cursor:pointer}.wrap{max-width:1160px;margin:auto;padding-left:32px;padding-right:32px}.sitebar{height:76px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;padding:0 max(24px,calc((100vw - 1096px)/2));border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--surface)}.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:var(--ink);font-size:22px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:-.04em}.brand span{display:block;width:32px;height:32px}.brand svg,.mini-mark svg,.closing-mark svg{width:100%;height:100%}.sitebar nav,.header-actions{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:24px}.sitebar nav a{font-size:13px;color:var(--ink);padding:12px 0}.header-actions{gap:12px}select{background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:20px;padding:8px 12px;min-height:44px}option{background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink)}.button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:52px;padding:14px 26px;border-radius:28px;background:#0071e3;color:#fff;font-weight:600;font-size:16px}.button:hover{background:#0063c7}.button.small{min-height:40px;padding:10px 20px;font-size:13px}.hero{text-align:center;padding-top:76px}.eyebrow{font-size:12px;font-weight:650;letter-spacing:.13em;color:var(--muted)}h1,h2,h3,p{margin-top:0}h1{font-size:clamp(56px,7.7vw,100px);letter-spacing:-.065em;line-height:1.02;margin:20px 0 24px;font-weight:650}.lede{font-size:clamp(19px,2.2vw,25px);color:var(--muted);line-height:1.45}.actions{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:28px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:32px}.text-link{font-weight:550;min-height:44px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center}.text-link:hover{text-decoration:underline}.caption{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:16px 0 0}.browser{margin:64px auto 0;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;text-align:left;background:var(--surface);box-shadow:0 24px 60px #00000012}.chrome{display:flex;align-items:center;padding:10px 16px 0;gap:16px;background:var(--soft)}.mini-mark{width:24px;height:24px;display:block}.preview-tabs{display:flex;flex:1;gap:5px}.preview-tabs button{border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--muted);padding:12px 20px;border-radius:10px 10px 0 0;min-height:44px}.preview-tabs button[aria-selected="true"]{color:var(--ink);background:var(--surface)}.window-dots{color:var(--muted);font-size:15px}.addressbar{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:center;padding:10px 22px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.addressbar>div{background:var(--bg);flex:1;border-radius:8px;padding:6px 18px;font-size:12px}.preview-page{position:relative;padding:72px 64px 64px;overflow:hidden;min-height:400px}.ambient{position:absolute;z-index:0;width:480px;height:480px;right:-90px;top:-35px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(ellipse,#87a9f42b,transparent 70%);pointer-events:none}.preview-page>*:not(.ambient){position:relative}.preview-page h2{font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,48px);letter-spacing:-.05em;line-height:1.1;margin-bottom:18px}.preview-page>p:not(.eyebrow){color:var(--muted)}.search-preview{max-width:570px;margin-top:32px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:16px 20px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);background:var(--surface)}kbd{font:inherit}.search-preview kbd{margin-left:auto;font-size:11px}.favorites{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:24px}.favorites span{padding:10px 18px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--soft);font-size:12px}.preview-caption{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);padding:12px 20px;margin:0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.intro{padding-top:116px}.intro>h2,.faq h2,.film h2,.closing h2{font-size:clamp(34px,4.8vw,58px);font-weight:650;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:18px 0 44px}.feature-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px}.feature{padding:36px;background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:24px;min-height:330px;overflow:hidden}.feature.wide{grid-column:span 2}.feature .number{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;margin-bottom:28px}.feature h3{font-size:30px;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin-bottom:20px}.feature p{color:var(--muted);font-size:16px;max-width:480px}.tab-art{display:flex;gap:8px;margin:36px -8px -36px;transform:rotate(-4deg)}.tab-art span{background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px 12px 0 0;padding:18px;font-size:13px;flex:1;white-space:nowrap}.tab-art .selected{background:var(--soft);transform:translateY(-9px)}.shortcut{display:inline-block;border:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom-width:4px;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:10px;font-size:15px;margin-top:22px}.swatches{display:flex;gap:12px;margin-top:32px}.swatches i{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:#32333d;border:3px solid var(--line)}.swatches i:nth-child(2){background:#d5d3cc}.swatches i:nth-child(3){background:#526a9a}.swatches i:nth-child(4){background:#bd7b60}.film{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:64px;padding-top:116px;align-items:center}.film h2{margin-bottom:24px}.film p{color:var(--muted)}.film-link{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:24px;aspect-ratio:16/10;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:24px;background:var(--surface);color:var(--ink)}.play{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:72px;height:72px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--soft);font-size:36px}.faq{padding-top:116px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.4fr;gap:64px}.questions details{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:22px 0}.questions summary{font-weight:600;min-height:32px}.questions p{color:var(--muted);margin:14px 0 0;font-size:15px}.closing{text-align:center;padding-top:116px;padding-bottom:100px}.closing-mark{display:block;width:64px;height:64px;margin:auto auto 24px}.closing h2{margin-bottom:32px}footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;gap:24px;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:28px;padding-bottom:28px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}footer a{color:var(--muted)}footer>div{display:flex;gap:20px}.skip{position:absolute;top:-80px;left:16px;padding:12px;background:var(--surface);z-index:20}.skip:focus{top:8px}.sr-only{position:absolute;width:1px;height:1px;overflow:hidden;clip:rect(0,0,0,0)}
@media(max-width:760px){.sitebar{height:68px;padding:0 20px;gap:12px}.sitebar nav{display:none}.brand{font-size:20px}.header-actions{gap:8px}.header-actions select{font-size:12px;max-width:90px}.button.small{padding:10px 14px}.wrap{padding-left:20px;padding-right:20px}.hero{padding-top:52px}h1{font-size:64px}.actions{gap:16px}.browser{margin-top:44px;border-radius:14px}.chrome{padding:6px 6px 0;gap:6px}.mini-mark,.window-dots{display:none}.preview-tabs button{padding:10px 8px;font-size:12px;flex:1}.addressbar{padding:8px 12px;gap:8px}.preview-page{padding:42px 24px;min-height:345px}.search-preview{padding:12px;font-size:11px}.favorites{gap:8px}.favorites span{padding:8px 10px;font-size:10px}.intro,.film,.faq,.closing{padding-top:72px}.feature-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.feature.wide{grid-column:auto}.feature{padding:28px;min-height:0}.tab-art{margin-bottom:-28px}.feature h3{font-size:30px}.film,.faq{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:24px}.film h2,.faq h2{margin-bottom:20px}.closing{padding-bottom:64px}footer{flex-wrap:wrap;gap:18px}footer>div{width:100%}}
@media(max-width:380px){h1{font-size:54px}.brand span{display:none}.header-actions{gap:6px}.sitebar{padding:0 16px}.header-actions select{padding:8px}.actions{flex-direction:column;gap:8px}}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}
</style></body></html>
